minimum dimensions of<MET> 559 mm</MET><ENG> 22 inches</ENG> wide by<MET> 508 mm</MET><ENG> 20 inches</ENG> front to rear, with two supply openings in<MET> 254 mm</MET><ENG> 10 inch</ENG> high back.  Provide floor 
