<TXT><RID>ANSI/ASHRAE 18</RID>, <RID>UL 399</RID>, <RID>NSF/ANSI/CAN 61</RID>, ADA and <RID>ICC A117.1</RID>.  [Single][ and ][Dual] height water cooler with more than a single thickness of metal 
