mm</MET><ENG> 15 inches</ENG> high rim for through-the-floor drain installation with bathtub bottom or feet firmly supported by a smooth level floor.  Provide left 
or right drain outlet bathtub as required.<TAI OPT="AIR FORCE">[  Provide filters for chlorine in supply piping to faucets.]</TAI>  Bathtubs must meet performance requirements 
