<BRK/>
<TXT><RID>ASME A112.19.1/CSA B45.2</RID>, [white][_____] porcelain bonded to enameling grade metal, bonded to a structural composite, recessed type, minimum dimensions 
of<MET> 1524 mm</MET><ENG> 60 inches</ENG> wide by<MET> 762 mm</MET><ENG> 30 inches</ENG> front to rear by<MET> 406 mm</MET><ENG> 16 inches</ENG> high with drain outlet for above-the-floor drain installation.  
